    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d258">

                <pb facs="0355" n="251" xml:id="pg251"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/2535: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Switzerland (Wilson) to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Geneva</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1932-11-18T21:00:00+01:00">November 18,
                            1932—9 p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received November 18—3:35 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>44. Your 34, November 17, 7 p.m., caused great satisfaction to Drummond. He has
                    noted the alteration suggested in relation to points 2 and 3 and quite
                    understands its advantage. He has requested me to put De Valera in touch with
                    the situation on his arrival tomorrow which I shall do.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
